/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:113:- The largest foreground color forms several one-pixel-thick rectangular lattice frames.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:114:- The frame lines divide each lattice into the same row-by-column set of rectangular slots; some slots already contain one non-frame color.
