/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:147:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:148:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:149:- The grid is made from three or more equal panels in one row or one column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:150:- The final input panel is the static target template; every earlier panel differs from it only by dynamic colors absent from the template.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:151:- Each dynamic color appears in a regular temporal schedule across the earlier panels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:152:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:153:Rule
