/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:155:- For every dynamic color whose schedule reaches the next panel, compare its last two appearances.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:156:- Extrapolate each one-dimensional interval along the color's changing row or column axis and paint that predicted mask.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:157:
