/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:202:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:203:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:204:- The top row is a palette row with exactly one background gap.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:205:- Below it, the only foreground is one vertical marker bar of a single color.
