/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:224:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:225:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:226:- The grid has a background color and exactly one foreground color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:227:- All foreground pixels form one contiguous horizontal bar in the top row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:228:- The bar starts at the left edge; its length is the control value n.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:229:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:230:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:231:- Build a one-dimensional sequence of foreground runs with lengths
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:232:  1, 2, ..., n, n-1, ..., 2, 1.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:233:- Separate adjacent runs by one background pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:234:- Wrap the sequence row-major across the input width and pad the final row
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:235:  with background pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:236:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:237:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:238:The output preserves the input width; the bar length controls the run-length
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:239:diamond, and the apparent 2D pattern is just that 1D sequence wrapped into rows.
