/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:247:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:248:- The grid contains a fixed yellow/orange divider structure.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:249:- All other colors form separated 4-connected monochrome regions around that divider.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:250:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:251:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:252:- Leave the yellow and orange pixels unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:253:- Sort the non-divider regions by their centroid angle around the divider centroid in screen-coordinate clockwise order.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:254:- Each region keeps its cells and receives the color of the previous region in that cyclic order.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:255:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:256:Key insight:
