/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:264:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:265:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:266:- The background is the most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:267:- There is one 8-connected non-background sprite that is not a solid 2x2 square.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:268:- There is one solid 2x2 square anchor in another non-background color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:269:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:270:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:271:- Move the sprite straight toward the anchor along their unique cardinal separation until it touches the anchor's near edge.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:272:- Reflect the moved sprite across that near edge and draw the reflected copy in the anchor color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:273:- Clear the original locations; the output keeps only the moved sprite and reflected anchor-color copy.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:274:
