/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:283:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:284:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:285:The grid has a dominant background color, a regular lattice color, one large
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:286:sparse rectangular frame, and one or more external monochrome sprites whose
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:287:pixels also sit on a two-step lattice.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:288:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:289:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:290:Use the largest sparse rectangular perimeter as the frame. Clear that frame
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:291:region and the external sprite pixels to background, draw a solid one-pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:292:border in the frame color, solidify each sparse sprite into its contiguous
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:293:two-step mask, and place the sprites inside the frame with equal gaps.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:294:Wide frames receive sprites left-to-right by source position; tall frames
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:295:receive them top-to-bottom by source position.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:296:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:297:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:298:The frame supplies ordered slots: the sprite-to-slot assignment is by visible
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:299:source order, not by numeric color or by matching individual cells.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:300:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:301:</reference_puzzle>
