/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:310:- Unique single-pixel colors on the grid border mark seed endpoints of each line.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:311:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:312:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:313:- Each border seed pixel connects (8-connected) to a line drawing.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:314:- Find closed bg cavities whose boundary touches that line.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:315:- Flood-fill each such cavity with the seed pixel's color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:316:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:317:Key insight: Only cavities reachable through the seed's own line get filled; the seed's unique color acts as a per-line fill label.
