/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:323:Pack the colored sprites along the bottom edge from smallest to largest.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:324:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:325:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:326:The grid has a dominant background color and several monochrome 4-connected
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:327:foreground sprites; a full-grid one-cell frame may surround the scene.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:328:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:329:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:330:Remove any full-grid rectangular frame, sort the remaining sprites by pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:331:area from smallest to largest, and paste their bounding-box sprites left to
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:332:right with each sprite bottom-aligned.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:333:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:334:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:335:The original locations do not determine the final slots; each sprite's area
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:336:gives the packing order, while its shape and color are preserved.
