/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:359:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:360:Mark the missing center of each plus-shaped arrangement of four two-pixel bars with yellow.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:361:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:362:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:363:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:364:- The single foreground color forms isolated 4-connected objects, each a horizontal or vertical two-pixel bar.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:365:- Some bars form an implied plus sign: two horizontal bars and two vertical bars around an empty center, with a one-pixel gap between the center and each bar.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:366:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:367:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:368:- Keep the input unchanged except at implied plus-sign centers.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:369:- For every background pixel with foreground bars at offsets 2-3 cells left, right, above, and below, recolor that center yellow.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:370:- The one-pixel gaps immediately next to the center in the four cardinal directions must remain background.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:371:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:372:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:373:- The yellow pixels are not extending a line; they identify the shared missing center where four separated two-pixel bars align as a plus sign.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:374:</description>
