/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:378:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:379:Crop a board cluster and rotate its color layers based on outside cue sprites.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:380:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:381:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:382:- bg = most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:383:- A main multi-color board cluster (largest foreground region).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:384:- Small monochrome cue sprites outside the board for the colors that rotate.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:385:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:386:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:387:- Tight-crop around the board cluster.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:388:- For each color layer inside the crop, find its same-color cue outside.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:389:- Rotate that layer clockwise by (cue pixel count mod 4) × 90°.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:390:- No outside cue → no rotation.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:391:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:392:Key insight: Cue sprite size mod 4 encodes rotation amount for its matching color layer.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/2/prompt.md:393:</description>
